ess or two aspects might even be represented by one figure on which both the snake and the bird appear as at Kannia. That these figures represent the same goddess with separate aspects could explain why equipment with different symbols might be found in a shrine with only snake goddess figures as at Gournia” '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2792, 'temperature': 0.2})
