y, a succession dispute divided the Ismāʿīlīs into the Nizārī and the Mustaʿlī branches, and the latter in its turn was divided into the Ḥāfiẓī and the Ṭayyibī movements.” '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2820, 'temperature': 0.2})
